259| \begin{example}[水的九克]\label{ex:g10:the-mole:nine}
260| % ledger: aw:H, aw:O, const:NA
261| \qty{9.0}{g} 水中有多少个分子？$M(\ce{H2O}) =
262| \qty{18.0}{g/mol}$，故
263| \[
264|   n = \frac{\qty{9.0}{g}}{\qty{18.0}{g/mol}} = \qty{0.50}{mol},
265|   \qquad
266|   N = \qty{0.50}{mol} \times \qty{6.02e23}{mol^{-1}}
267|     = \num{3.0e23} \text{ 个分子。}
268| \]
269| \end{example}
